<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>SahSah Tech — Driven by Innovation</title>
  <meta name="description" content="SahSah Tech: 5G hardware, edge automation, and automotive telemetry. Istanbul-based, globally connected." />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon-512.png" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="SahSah Tech — 5G Hardware & Automation" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Driven by Innovation. Premium 5G & automation systems engineered in Istanbul." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://sahsahtech.vercel.app/images/ferrari-f8.jpg" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0a12" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --gold: #e0b341;
      --bg: #0b0a12;
      --card: #15131f;
      --muted: #a9a7b3;
      --radius: 18px;
      --shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body {
      margin: 0; background: radial-gradient(1000px 800px at 70% -10%, #251c4f55, transparent 70%), #0b0a12;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #eee;
    }
    a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none}
    header {
      display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
      padding:18px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    }
    header h1 {
      margin:0;font-family:"Playfair Display",serif;font-size:24px;color:var(--gold);
      letter-spacing:.3px;
    }
    main {max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 22px;}
    .hero {text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;}
    .hero h2 {font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,52px);margin-bottom:14px;}
    .hero p {max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted);}
    .cta {margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}
    .btn {
      padding:12px 20px;border-radius:12px;border:none;font-weight:600;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#f7d973);color:#0b0a12;
      cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(224,179,65,.25);
    }
    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);transition:.2s;}
    section.grid {
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
      gap:20px;margin-top:40px;
    }
    .card {
      background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }
    .card h3 {margin:0 0 8px;font-family:"Playfair Display",serif;color:var(--gold);}
    footer {
      text-align:center;padding:30px 16px;color:#a7a4bb;font-size:14px;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);margin-top:50px;
    }

    /* Automotive gallery */
    #automotive {margin-top:80px;}
    .auto-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:24px;}
    .auto-card {
      border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      transition:transform .3s ease;
    }
    .auto-card:hover {transform:translateY(-4px);}
    .auto-img {width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
    .auto-cap {padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;color:#bbb;}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>⚡ SahSah Tech</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#solutions">Solutions</a> • 
      <a href="#automotive">Automotive</a> • 
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <h2>Driven by Innovation — 5G Hardware & Automation</h2>
      <p>High-performance 5G gateways, rugged edge computing and turnkey automation systems engineered for reliability, speed and style.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:contact@sahsahtech.com">Contact Us</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#automotive">Explore Automotive</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="solutions" class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>5G Hardware</h3>
        <p>Carrier-grade modules and antennas with global certification and ultra-low latency.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Automation</h3>
        <p>Edge AI + PLC integration for real-time control, diagnostics, and efficiency.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Support</h3>
        <p>From Istanbul HQ to global logistics — on-site rollout, service and quality assurance.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="automotive">
      <h2 class="gold" style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">Automotive Telemetry & 5G Integration</h2>
      <p style="max-width:700px;color:var(--muted);">
        Real-time data, over-the-air diagnostics and sub-10 ms latency for supercars and industrial fleets.  
        Engineered with precision — built for the road ahead.
      </p>
      <div class="auto-grid">
        <figure class="auto-card">
          <img src="images/rr-range.jpg" alt="Rolls Royce & Range Rover" class="auto-img" />
          <figcaption class="auto-cap">Rolls-Royce & Range Rover — Convoy Telemetry</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="auto-card">
          <img src="images/ferrari-f8.jpg" alt="Ferrari F8 Tributo" class="auto-img" />
          <figcaption class="auto-cap">Ferrari F8 Tributo — 4K Vision & Edge AI</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="auto-card">
          <img src="images/ferrari-812.jpg" alt="Ferrari 812 Superfast" class="auto-img" />
          <figcaption class="auto-cap">Ferrari 812 Superfast — Live Track Telemetry</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" style="text-align:center;margin-top:70px;">
      <h2>Let's build, in style.</h2>
      <p>Istanbul • Global logistics • NDA-friendly</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:contact@sahsahtech.com">Email Us</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://sahsahtech.com">sahsahtech.com</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © <span id="y"></span> SahSah Tech — Driven by Innovation • 5G Hardware & Automation • Istanbul  
    <br><a href="mailto:contact@sahsahtech.com">contact@sahsahtech.com</a>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("y").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
